: mid \u escape sequence. Any parser that attempts json.Unmarshal on a fragment,
: or that trims whitespace from one, corrupts the result. Fragments are only ever
: concatenated; parsing happens once, at the end.
:
: Reassembled arguments are exactly:
:   {"text":"a\"b\\c","note":"café \n done"}
